repository-code: "https://github.com/Honghui-Du/JAX-WAVE"
url: "https://github.com/Honghui-Du/JAX-WAVE"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  JAX-WAVE learns a shared inverse map from target wave fields and known
  heterogeneous wave-speed maps to bounded initial pressures, using
  differentiable propagation and exact target-sign symmetry.
keywords:
  - inverse wave design
  - initial-pressure design
  - amortized inverse design
  - differentiable simulation
  - heterogeneous media
  - sign symmetry
preferred-citation:
  type: unpublished
  title: "JAX-WAVE: A Differentiable Physics-Supervised Framework for Inverse Wave Design in Heterogeneous Media"
